7 Awards 8 References 9 External links Plot The school year ends with everyone at East High School looking forward to summer vacation ( `` What Time Is It '' ) . Troy Bolton is still dating Gabriella Montez , who decides to stay in Albuquerque with her mother . Troy eventually decides to look for a summer job to gain money for college . Sharpay and Ryan Evans plan to spend part of the summer at their family 's country club , Lava Springs ( `` Fabulous '' ) , but Sharpay 's summer plans also include pursuing Troy , whom she has arranged to be hired at the club . However , Troy convinces the club 's manager , Mr. Fulton , into hiring Gabriella and their close group of friends as well ; including Taylor and Chad . Sharpay is enraged upon learning that Gabriella is working as one of the lifeguards , but is unable to get her fired . So she orders Fulton to give them difficult tasks so they would be best to quit . Fulton attempts to intimidate the group , but Troy rebuilds their confidence and convinces them that they can persevere ( `` Work This Out '' ) .","entities":["High School Musical 2","Gabriella's mother","Lava Springs","Mr. Fulton","Troy Bolton","Gabriella Montez","Ryan Evans","East High School","What Time Is It","Fabulous","Work This Out","Sharpay","Chad","Taylor","Albuquerque"],"facts":["High School Musical 2 -RELATED_TO-> north region","High School Musical 2 -RELATED_TO-> Disney Channel UK","High School Musical 2 -RELATED_TO-> Rotten Tomatoes","High School Musical 2 -RELATED_TO-> Metacritic","High School Musical 2 -LOCATED_IN-> United States"]}

