Henry allows Alec to keep the Black in his barn . When Alec wonders how fast the Black is , Alec and Henry decide to train the Black for the racetrack , while Henry teaches Alec how to be a jockey . The Black surprises Henry with his speed . Henry immediately starts plotting to get the Black into a match race between two of the country 's current champions , to be held at Santa Anita , California . To do that , he sets up a secret demonstration at night where the press can witness his speed , keeping the identity of Alec and the Black secret . The news about the mystery horse is soon widespread and the Black is entered into the race . The race is the most anticipated horse - racing event of the year . Before the two champions and the Black enter the starting gate , the Black gets into a fight with one of his opponents , wounding his leg . Alec does not see the wound until he is in the gate . As he dismounts , the bell rings and the horses take off . Alec desperately tries to stay on his horse and trying to stop him . He falls behind , but the Black wo n't stop .","entities":["The Black Stallion","Alec","the Black","match race","secret demonstration","Santa Anita","Henry","California"],"facts":["The Black Stallion -LOCATED_IN-> Sardinia","The Black Stallion -RELATED_TO-> English","The Black Stallion -RELATED_TO-> American Zoetrope","The Black Stallion -RELATED_TO-> Cass Ole","The Black Stallion -LOCATED_IN-> United States"]}

