List of the Fall characters - wikipedia List of the Fall characters Jump to : navigation , search The Fall , starring Gillian Anderson , is a British - Irish drama series produced by Artists Studio and created by Allan Cubitt . It premiered in the Republic of Ireland at 21 : 30 on 12 May 2013 , and in the UK on BBC Two at 21 : 00 on 13 May 2013 . The series features Jamie Dornan , with John Lynch , Bronagh Waugh , Stuart Graham , and Niamh McGrady . Contents ( hide ) 1 Cast overview 2 Main characters 2.1 Det . Supt . Stella Gibson 2.2 Peter Paul Spector 2.3 Asst . Ch . Constable Jim Burns 2.4 Katie Benedetto 2.5 Sally Ann Spector 2.6 PC Danielle Ferrington 2.7 Det . Ch . Insp . Matthew Eastwood 2.8 DC Gail McNally 2.9 Rose Stagg 2.10 DC Glen Martin 2.11 Professor Reed Smith 2.12 DC Rick Turner 2.13 Det .","entities":["The Fall","Artists Studio","Allan Cubitt","The Fall premiere in the Republic of Ireland","The Fall premiere in the UK","Det. Supt. Stella Gibson","Asst. Ch. Constable Jim Burns","PC Danielle Ferrington","Det. Ch. Insp. Matthew Eastwood","DC Gail McNally","Professor Reed Smith","DC Rick Turner","Gillian Anderson","Jamie Dornan","John Lynch"],"facts":["The Fall -RELATED_TO-> Facebook","The Fall -RELATED_TO-> RTÉ","The Fall -RELATED_TO-> Rotten Tomatoes","The Fall -RELATED_TO-> BBC Programmes","The Fall -RELATED_TO-> IMDb"]}
