[E7a8baa] {"title":"People's Postcode Lottery","text":"People's Postcode Lottery
Beneficiaries ( edit ) A minimum of 32 % goes to various trusts , which in turn provide funding to charities and community projects across Great Britain and internationally . As an external lottery manager , People 's Postcode Lottery manages several society lotteries promoted by different charities . Over 4,000 causes have received support . Ambassadors ( edit ) People 's Postcode Lottery has a number of celebrity `` ambassadors '' . In March 2018 , these included David Attenborough , Clare Balding , Brian Blessed , Judi Dench , Shobna Gulati , Tim Healy , Stephen Jardine , Ellen MacArthur , Aggie MacKenzie , Carey Mulligan , John Stapleton and Emma Thompson . Fiona Phillips became an ambassador for People 's Postcode Lottery at the end of 2012 , leading the organisation 's DRTV campaigns . Presenters Judie McCourt , Danyl Johnson , Jeff Brazier and Matt Johnson visit People 's Postcode Lottery winners to present them with their cheques , attend Postcode Million events and take part in People 's Postcode Lottery advertising campaigns .","entities":["Great Britain","Carey Mulligan","Brian Blessed","Charities","People's Postcode Lottery","various trusts","community projects","causes","society lotteries","Postcode Million events","DRTV campaigns","advertising campaigns","People's Postcode Lottery winners","cheques","Clare Balding"],"facts":["People's Postcode Lottery -LOCATED_IN-> Great Britain","British Grey Knotts mines -LOCATED_IN-> Great Britain","Oxford University Press -LOCATED_IN-> Great Britain","Cassidy Live! -LOCATED_IN-> Great Britain","decline of mercantilism in Great Britain -LOCATED_IN-> Great Britain"]}
