) `` Sayonara Tokyo '' ( 1981 ) `` Total Eclipse of the Heart '' ( 1983 ) `` Take Me Back '' ( 1983 ) Music video `` Total Eclipse Of The Heart '' on YouTube `` Total Eclipse of the Heart '' is a song recorded by Welsh singer Bonnie Tyler . It was written and produced by Jim Steinman , and released on Tyler 's fifth studio album , Faster Than the Speed of Night ( 1983 ) . The song was released as a single by Columbia Records on 11 February 1983 in the United Kingdom and on 31 May 1983 in the United States . The song became Tyler 's biggest career hit , topping the UK Singles Chart , and becoming the fifth - best - selling single in 1983 in the United Kingdom . In the United States , the single spent four weeks at the top of the charts , and was Billboard 's number - six song of the year for 1983 .","entities":["United States","Release of Total Eclipse of the Heart in the United Kingdom","Release of Total Eclipse of the Heart in the United States","Jim Steinman","Faster Than the Speed of Night","Total Eclipse of the Heart","Bonnie Tyler","Billboard","United Kingdom","UK Singles Chart","Columbia Records"],"facts":["United States -PART_OF-> Americas","United States -PART_OF-> Northern America","United States -PART_OF-> these ten countries","United States -PART_OF-> The Americas","United States -PART_OF-> Beekeeping by countries"]}
