In April 2017 , Horowitz and Kitsis confirmed that a group of characters will indeed have their stories wrapped up by the end of the season in acknowledging the potential cast changes , saying : `` We planned this finale from the beginning of the year , so whoever stays and whoever goes ... all those questions have already been dealt with . The audience does not have to fear ( anything feeling ) incomplete . '' On May 8 , Morrison confirmed that she had declined an offer to remain on the show and that the sixth season would be her last , signaling the end of Emma 's time on the show as the main protagonist . On May 11 , Rebecca Mader announced that she would also be leaving the show at the end of the season , citing creative decisions beyond her control . On May 12 , season six was announced to be the last for four additional main actors : Ginnifer Goodwin , Josh Dallas , Jared Gilmore , and Emilie de Ravin . Thus , characters seeing their storylines wrapped up in the season six finale include Emma Swan , Snow White , Prince Charming , Belle , and Zelena .","entities":["Prince Charming","Snow White","Rebecca Mader","Ginnifer Goodwin","Josh Dallas","Jared Gilmore","Emilie de Ravin","Belle","Emma Swan","Zelena","Morrison","Confirmation that characters' stories would be wrapped up","Morrison confirmed she declined the offer to remain on the show","Rebecca Mader announced she would leave the show","Season six announced as the last for four additional main actors"],"facts":["Prince Charming -RELATED_TO-> Disney's Sleeping Beauty characters","Prince Charming -RELATED_TO-> William Phipps","Prince Charming -RELATED_TO-> Cinderella","Prince Charming -RELATED_TO-> Waverly Substation","Prince Charming -RELATED_TO-> royal party"]}
