Describing it as one of the best pop concerts of the year and likening the high production values to those of Kylie Minogue , Bruton noted that Steps sang live throughout the show and that each band member `` a chance to show off '' . She added that small touches such as Ian `` H '' Watkins being partnered with a male dancer and the group embracing each other during their rendition of `` Heartbeat '' considering that they were not on speaking terms in 2009 `` shows how far they 've come . '' Bruton concluded by writing that for a pop band `` to survive the 1990s is one thing but for a pop group to come back 20 years later with a top - 10 album and a slick tour like this is little short of a miracle , '' and called the church wedding procession during the closing song `` Tragedy '' the `` best thing ever . '' Set list ( edit ) The following set list is representative of the show in Newcastle at the Metro Radio Arena on 20 November 2017 . It may not represent the setlist from all of the shows .","entities":["Kylie Minogue","Heartbeat","Newcastle","Bruton","Ian H Watkins","Tragedy","show in Newcastle","Metro Radio Arena","Party on the Dancefloor Tour","Steps"],"facts":["Kylie Minogue -RELATED_TO-> Les classement single","Kylie Minogue -RELATED_TO-> Media Control Charts","Kylie Minogue -RELATED_TO-> Billboard","Kylie Minogue -RELATED_TO-> Your Disco Needs You","Kylie Minogue -RELATED_TO-> Lescharts.com"]}
