The contestants and judges were asked about their definition of love . Prakash , Singh and Bharadwaj were called on stage by Shetty and they were asked to choose three guys . Gandotra , Ahlawat and Vali were asked to pair up with the ladies and dance with a prop ( Orange ) . This was a close dance and Singh and Gandotra won the contest . The fun quotient was enjoyed by the rest of the contestants a lot . Sharma was the spotlight winner of this week and she portrayed the life of warrior queen Rani Lakshmibai . This power packed performance was loved by everyone . Shetty stated that he felt that he is watching a play on the stage . The difficulties of holding a baby and doing a sword fight was narrated by Sharma . She got a score of nineteen . It was also informed that she was the captain in the academy and she handled the ' ' Roudra Ras ' ' ( anger ) very well . ' ' Ek tarfa pyar ki taaqat hi kuch aur hoti hai ' ' ( One sided love has a lot of power ) was the dialogue for the third act .","entities":["Orange","India's Next Superstars","Prakash","roudra ras","Singh","Shetty","Rani Lakshmibai","contest","Bharadwaj","Ahlawat","Vali","Gandotra","Sharma","academy","love"],"facts":["Orange -RELATED_TO-> Campari","Orange -RELATED_TO-> Curaçao","Orange -RELATED_TO-> Triple sec","Orange -RELATED_TO-> Cedratine","India's Next Superstars -LOCATED_IN-> India"]}
[E073e95] {"title":"India's Next Superstars","text":"India's Next Superstars
Episode 23 This episode was aired on 31 Mar 2018 ( Saturday ) . This was the semi-finale weekend . The contestants were mentored by judge Shetty and all the contestants were very happy . Their performance appeared a notch above their previous ones . Johar and Shetty introduced all the eight semi-finalists and took a grand entry with them . Sharma and Bharadwaj started the show with a traditional Ghoomar dance performance from the famous movie Padmaavat . The judges appreciated their performance and mentioned that it looked like two Deepika Padukone are dancing on the stage . This dance form is very difficult to perform with a pot on the head , and brass plates in hand . The mixed another dance form using elastics giving the feel of dolls dancing with strings ( Kathputli ) . It had some moves of robotics . Both scored a perfect five . Even when Sharma 's plate fell off , she still maintained her composure . Later Deo and Gandotra were given the task of doing the same dance after balancing the pots on their head . The comedy made everyone laugh .","entities":["robotics","India's Next Superstars","Deepika Padukone","Shetty","Bharadwaj","Gandotra","Sharma","Padmaavat","Deo","Episode 23","Ghoomar","Ghoomar dance performance","Kathputli","Johar"],"facts":["robotics -RELATED_TO-> navigation","Vanishing point -RELATED_TO-> robotics","Toyota -RELATED_TO-> robotics","robotics -RELATED_TO-> autonomous vehicles","India's Next Superstars -LOCATED_IN-> India"]}
[Edf8255] {"title":"India's Next Superstars","text":"India's Next Superstars
The judges stated that they liked the performance of the girls more than that of the boys . Bagri who was the winner of the spotlight challenge depicted the life of ace cricketer Yuvraj Singh very successfully on stage . The roars and clapping from the audience clearly showed how much they appreciated this act . The tragic portion of the act when Singh was battling with cancer brought tears to the eyes of many . Shetty was very impressed with the performance , and mentioned that it 's good that he did n't try to copy Singh , it would have looked comic . Bagri talked about the battle his father had to fight when he was detected with cancer . The final score for this act was a perfect ten . Kapur and Ahlawat presented a sweet act based on Karva Chauth . The judges liked the way Ahlawat picked up the Hariyanvi dialect and gave him a score of six . They pointed out the areas of improvement for him . This was the lowest score for the evening which later created Ahlawat 's exit . Kapur scored six for the act too .","entities":["cancer","India's Next Superstars","Kapur","Shetty","Yuvraj Singh","Bagri's act","Bagri's father","Ahlawat","Kapur and Ahlawat's act","Karva Chauth","Hariyanvi dialect","Ahlawat's exit","spotlight challenge","Bagri"],"facts":["cancer -RELATED_TO-> postmenopausal women","Comeback -RELATED_TO-> cancer","When You Can't Come Back -RELATED_TO-> cancer","Dave Dravecky -RELATED_TO-> cancer","cancer -RELATED_TO-> Dave Dravecky"]}

[E831188] {"title":"List of Fairy Tail episodes (season 6)","text":"List of Fairy Tail episodes (season 6)
The following day as the Grand Magic Games continue , an event called `` Pandemonium '' begins . It involves the participants entering a magical citadel filled with 100 monsters of varying strengths and individually doing battle with any number of monsters they choose . Representing Fairy Tail Team A , Erza requests the 100 monsters as her opponents . 167 `` 100 Against 1 '' `` Hyaku tai Ichi '' ( 100 対 1 ) February 2 , 2013 September 1 , 2015 Erza kills the 100 monsters using various types of armor to match their strength and weaknesses . As a result , the crowd praises Fairy Tail , and the guild is awarded with 10 points . Moreover , the game officials decided to determine the ranks of the remaining participants by means of a device called `` Magic Power Finder '' ( sometimes abbreviated as MPF ) . Using this tool , participants must attack it with their magic power , which will , in turn , calculate and display their equivalent scores depending on the extent of power used .","entities":["Fairy Tail","Erza","Grand Magic Games","Pandemonium","magical citadel","Fairy Tail Team A","100 monsters","100 Against 1","Magic Power Finder"],"facts":["Fairy Tail -LOCATED_IN-> Fiore","Fairy Tail -LOCATED_IN-> abandoned guildhall","Fairy Tail -LOCATED_IN-> spirit world","Fairy Tail -LOCATED_IN-> arena","Fairy Tail -LOCATED_IN-> Magnolia"]}
[E0b7ae8] {"title":"List of Fairy Tail episodes (season 6)","text":"List of Fairy Tail episodes (season 6)
The three ask Fairy Tail for their help in determining the source of a magical anomaly similar to Zeref 's magic that they have sensed around the Grand Magic Games arena , Domus Flau . In exchange , Ultear uses her magic to invoke their Second Origin in order to double their magic power . As the others undergo the painful process of awakening their Second Origin , Erza talks with Jellal over his regained memories . The two nearly kiss , but Jellal decides that he and Erza can not be together and lies to her that he has a fiancée . Erza quickly picks up on this and respects his decision , seeing Crime Sorcière off as they leave . 155 `` Crocus , the Flower - Blooming Capital '' `` Hanasaku Miyako : Kurokkasu '' ( 花 笑 く 都 ・ クロッカス ) November 3 , 2012 December 15 , 2015 Natsu , Lucy , Gray , Erza , and Wendy are chosen to represent their guild in the Grand Magic Games , which are to be held in Fiore 's capital , Crocus .","entities":["Fiore","Fairy Tail","Crime Sorcière","Zeref","Erza","Gray","Grand Magic Games","Crocus","Domus Flau","Second Origin","magical anomaly","Crocus, the Flower-Blooming Capital","Wendy","Lucy","Jellal"],"facts":["Fairy Tail -LOCATED_IN-> abandoned guildhall","Fairy Tail -LOCATED_IN-> spirit world","Saber Tooth guild -RELATED_TO-> Fiore","Fairy Tail -LOCATED_IN-> Magnolia","Fairy Tail -LOCATED_IN-> arena"]}
