In the end , Cana of Fairy Tail Team B dominates the event by using the Fairy Glitter spell lent to her by Mavis , much to Makarov 's surprise . With Cana 's victory , Fairy Tail Team B receives 8 points , and the audience began to burst once more into a resounding swarm of cheers and claps due to the finish of the two Fairy Tail teams . Meanwhile , the Raven Tail team somehow managed to get an insider information regarding the battle matchups for the day , so the masked leader Alexei tells his subordinates Flare , Obra , Nalpudding , and Kurohebi that it 's about time to proceed with their true mission . 168 `` Laxus vs. Alexei '' `` Rakusasu vs. Arekusei '' ( ラクサス vs. アレクセイ ) February 9 , 2013 September 1 , 2015 In the battle portion of the Grand Magic Games ' third day , Milliana of Mermaid Heel beats Semmes of Quatro Puppy while Saber Tooth 's Rufus swiftly defeats Blue Pegasus ' Eve .","entities":["Mavis","Eve","Alexei","Fairy Tail","Makarov","Grand Magic Games","Blue Pegasus","Nalpudding","Rufus","Flare","Obra","Saber Tooth","Cana","Fairy Tail Team B","Fairy Glitter"],"facts":["Mavis -RELATED_TO-> Lumen Histoire","Mavis -RELATED_TO-> Olive Glover","Mavis -RELATED_TO-> Dee Johnson","Mavis -RELATED_TO-> Dee","Louise Foley -RELATED_TO-> Mavis"]}
