Giants -- Jets rivalry - wikipedia Giants -- Jets rivalry Jump to : navigation , search New York Giants -- New York Jets New York Giants New York Jets First meeting November 1 , 1970 NYG 22 , NYJ 10 Latest meeting August 26 , 2017 NYJ 31 , NYG 32 Next meeting TBA Statistics Meetings total 13 meetings All - time series Giants lead 8 - 5 - 0 Largest victory NYJ 26 , NYG 7 ( 1981 ) Current win streak Giants 2 ( 2016 - present ) The Giants -- Jets rivalry is an American football rivalry in the National Football League ( NFL ) between the New York Giants and New York Jets . It is an intra-city , interconference matchup between the two NFL teams based in the New York metropolitan area . Since 1984 , both clubs have been the only teams in the league to share a stadium at the same time . Thus , a Giants -- Jets game can be referred to as `` the shortest road trip in the league '' .","entities":["National Football League","American football","Giants–Jets rivalry","New York metropolitan area","Giants–Jets first meeting","Giants–Jets latest meeting","Giants–Jets largest victory","New York Giants","New York Jets"],"facts":["National Football League -PARTICIPATED_IN-> New Eight-Year, $14 Billion NFL Deal","National Football League -PARTICIPATED_IN-> ESPN's $15 B rights deal with NFL","National Football League -PARTICIPATED_IN-> NFL–AAFC merger","National Football League -PARTICIPATED_IN-> AFL–NFL merger","National Football League -PARTICIPATED_IN-> NFL announcement about British Eurosport showing Monday Night Football"]}
